# The JieLi toolchain, the assembler and the shell scripts all run on Linux (WSL on Windows):
# LF in the tree, always. Without this, a clone on Windows turns every file CRLF and `sh` dies on
# "set: Illegal option -".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ppm binary
*.wav binary
*.bin binary
*.fwsc binary
*.boot binary
